&lt;h2 id="机器学习"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ba%e5%99%a8%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%a0" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;机器学习
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="模型选择"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e6%a8%a1%e5%9e%8b%e9%80%89%e6%8b%a9" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;模型选择
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;del&gt;在
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/immich-app/immich/discussions/2377#discussioncomment-9722890"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Does the app support Chinise? #2377&lt;/a&gt;
中提到 &lt;code&gt;XLM-Roberta-Large-Vit-B-16Plus&lt;/code&gt; 支持多语言，但目前已过时&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;参考
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/immich-app/immich/discussions/17105#discussioncomment-12620002"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Which one of the multilingual CLIP models is better? #17105&lt;/a&gt;
使用 &lt;code&gt;XLM-Roberta-Large-ViT-H-14__frozen_laion5b_s13b_b90k&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;相关参考
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/immich-app/immich/discussions/11862"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Guide: Getting started with choosing a Machine Learning CLIP Model for Smart Search #11862&lt;/a&gt;
和
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://immich.app/docs/features/searching/#clip-models"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;immich docs: clip-models&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="硬件加速"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e7%a1%ac%e4%bb%b6%e5%8a%a0%e9%80%9f" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;硬件加速
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 id="openvino"&gt;&lt;a href="#openvino" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;openvino
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;参考文档
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://immich.app/docs/features/ml-hardware-acceleration/"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Hardware-Accelerated Machine Learning&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrated GPUs are more likely to experience issues than discrete GPUs,
especially for older processors or servers with low RAM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;!-- prettier-ignore --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;对于 iGPU 可能会出现许多问题，如在 N100 的机器上会导致 &lt;code&gt;SMART SEARCH&lt;/code&gt;
任务太慢，不如纯 CPU 快，且启动 1 分钟左右会自动断连，基本不可用。虽然在 WSL 中可以正常使用，
可能是由于微软的优化，不需要 immich 直接对接硬件，但速度还是不如 CPU 快！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;参考：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/immich-app/immich/pull/9072"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;docs(ml): clarify cuda and openvino requirements #9072&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://post.smzdm.com/p/182674/"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;绿联&amp;amp;群晖，分别使用 immich 机器学习的效能情况&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/immich-app/immich/discussions/14781"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Intel Alderlake gen12 Machine learning doesn&amp;rsquo;t use GPU (intel n100) #14781&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="负载均衡"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e8%b4%9f%e8%bd%bd%e5%9d%87%e8%a1%a1" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;负载均衡
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;在
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://immich.app/docs/guides/remote-machine-learning#load-balancing"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Load balancing&lt;/a&gt;
中提到&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While several URLs can be provided in the settings, they are tried
sequentially; there is no attempt to distribute load across multiple
containers. It is recommended to use a dedicated load balancer for such
use-cases and specify it as the only URL. Among other things, it may enable
the use of different APIs on the same server by running multiple containers
with different configurations. For example, one might run an OpenVINO
container in addition to a CUDA container, or run a standard release container
to maximize both CPU and GPU utilization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;可以同时启用 cpu/openvino 多个实例以提高 cpu/gpu 利用率，且模型内存可以共享。&lt;/p&gt;
