与
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://immich.app/docs/guides/better-facial-clusters"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Better Facial Recognition Clusters&lt;/a&gt;
总结为对于大型图库，在初始化识别时增加 &lt;code&gt;Minimum recognized faces&lt;/code&gt; 减少
&lt;code&gt;Maximum recognition distance&lt;/code&gt;
